      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_role_array_must_reserve_unknown_terminator",
      "fine_trace_step": 9,
      "description": "Root cause. On the witnessed sixth loop iteration, this store writes the last attacker-controlled nonzero role into `roles[5]`. Together with the earlier five nonzero stores, that exhausts the six-slot sentinel-terminated array and leaves no in-bounds `FU_COSWID_ENTITY_ROLE_UNKNOWN` entry for the later write-side scan. The patch fixes this by switching to a bitfield and rejecting invalid role values before setting it."
    },
